         body='// Store: the S3 calls the demo makes\ns3.putObjectRetention(PutObjectRetentionRequest.builder()\n        .bucket(bucket).key(key).versionId(versionId)\n        .retention(ObjectLockRetention.builder()\n                .mode(mode)\n                .retainUntilDate(until)\n                .build())',
